   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Internal CSS"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "An internal style sheet may be used if one single HTML page has a unique style."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The internal style is defined inside the <style> element, inside the head\nsection."
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "html",
   "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<style>\nbody {\n\n  background-color: linen;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: maroon;\n\n  margin-left: 40px;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>This is a\n  heading</h1>\n<p>This is a paragraph.</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
